  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Create a new instance of the <a href=\"ModelMBeanNotificationPublisher.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jmx.export.notification\"><code>ModelMBeanNotificationPublisher</code></a> class\nthat will publish all <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/Notification.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>Notifications</code></a>\nto the supplied <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/modelmbean/ModelMBean.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management.modelmbean\"><code>ModelMBean</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的 <a href=\"ModelMBeanNotificationPublisher.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jmx.export.notification\"><code>ModelMBeanNotificationPublisher</code></a> 类实例，用于向提供的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/modelmbean/ModelMBean.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management.modelmbean\"><code>ModelMBean</code></a> 发布所有 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/Notification.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>Notifications</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"NotificationPublisher.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.jmx.export.notification\"><code>NotificationPublisher</code></a> implementation that uses the infrastructure\nprovided by the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/modelmbean/ModelMBean.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management.modelmbean\"><code>ModelMBean</code></a> interface to track\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/NotificationListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>javax.management.NotificationListeners</code></a>\nand send <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/Notification.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>Notifications</code></a> to those listeners.",
      "translation": "使用由 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/modelmbean/ModelMBean.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management.modelmbean\"><code>ModelMBean</code></a> 接口提供的跟踪<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/NotificationListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>javax.management.NotificationListeners</code></a>并向这些监听器发送 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/Notification.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>Notifications</code></a> 的基础设施来实现的<a href=\"NotificationPublisher.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.jmx.export.notification\"><code>NotificationPublisher</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Send the supplied <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/Notification.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>Notification</code></a> using the wrapped\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/modelmbean/ModelMBean.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management.modelmbean\"><code>ModelMBean</code></a> instance.",
      "translation": "使用包装的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/modelmbean/ModelMBean.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management.modelmbean\"><code>ModelMBean</code></a>实例发送提供的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/Notification.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>Notification</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>objectName</code> - the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/ObjectName.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>ObjectName</code></a> of the source <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/modelmbean/ModelMBean.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management.modelmbean\"><code>ModelMBean</code></a>",
      "translation": "<code>objectName</code> - 源 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/modelmbean/ModelMBean.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management.modelmbean\"><code>ModelMBean</code></a> 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/ObjectName.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>ObjectName</code></a>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>modelMBean</code> - the target <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/modelmbean/ModelMBean.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management.modelmbean\"><code>ModelMBean</code></a>; must not be <code>null</code>",
      "translation": "<code>modelMBean</code> - 目标 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/modelmbean/ModelMBean.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management.modelmbean\"><code>ModelMBean</code></a>；不能为 <code>null</code>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"NotificationPublisher.html#sendNotification(javax.management.Notification)\">sendNotification</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"NotificationPublisher.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.jmx.export.notification\">NotificationPublisher</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"NotificationPublisher.html#sendNotification(javax.management.Notification)\">sendNotification</a></code>` 接口 `<code><a href=\"NotificationPublisher.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.jmx.export.notification\">NotificationPublisher</a></code>` 中",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - if the supplied <code>notification</code> is <code>null</code>",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - 如果提供的 <code>notification</code> 为 <code>null</code>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>managedResource</code> - the managed resource exposed by the supplied <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/modelmbean/ModelMBean.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management.modelmbean\"><code>ModelMBean</code></a>",
      "translation": "<code>managedResource</code> - 由提供的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/modelmbean/ModelMBean.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management.modelmbean\"><code>ModelMBean</code></a>暴露的托管资源",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - if any of the parameters is <code>null</code>",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - 如果任何参数为 <code>null</code>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>notification</code> - the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/Notification.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>Notification</code></a> to be sent",
      "translation": "<code>notification</code> - 要发送的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/Notification.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>Notification</code></a>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"UnableToSendNotificationException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jmx.export.notification\">UnableToSendNotificationException</a></code> - if the supplied <code>notification</code> could not be sent",
      "translation": "<code><a href=\"UnableToSendNotificationException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jmx.export.notification\">UnableToSendNotificationException</a></code> - 如果提供的 <code>notification</code> 无法发送",
      "count": 2
    },
